# M4N Frontend Environment Variables Template
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1
# Production behind a same-origin HTTPS reverse proxy: omit this key or set /api/v1.
# This is embedded at build time; frontend configuration never contains provider secrets.
# Optional local HTTPS tunnel demo (.env.local): use VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1,
# DEV_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:8080 and DEV_TUNNEL_HOST=<exact tunnel hostname>.
# The proxy keeps browser authentication on the frontend origin; never allow all hosts.
# Vercel deployment: VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1 and
# M4N_BACKEND_ORIGIN=https://<your-service>.up.railway.app (no trailing slash).
# vercel.mjs configures the API proxy and /payment-return SPA fallback.
